<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9335] IgniteOffheapReadWriteLockSelfTest.testTagIdUpdateContinuous() sometimes hangs on a barrier</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9335</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I am trying to uncomment IgniteOffheapReadWriteLockSelfTest but testTagIdUpdateContinuous() deadlocks every now and when on barr.await();&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please fix it and un-fail.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note that I also suggest changing wait time from 30 to 5 seconds per test, is that OK?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
