&lt;p&gt;More info see here: &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/c6013b99940de32aae831a0b76e8fd53febe5040e9e0d67abb4f62a5@%3Cdev.community.apache.org%3E&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/c6013b99940de32aae831a0b76e8fd53febe5040e9e0d67abb4f62a5@%3Cdev.community.apache.org%3E&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16587441" author="agoncharuk" created="Tue, 21 Aug 2018 13:32:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue was caused by a racy cyclic barrier breaking.&lt;br/&gt;
Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
